[{"start": 3.92, "end": 9.92, "text": "东韩末节,黄金旗在爆发后的第八个月极高平行。"}, {"start": 9.92, "end": 15.92, "text": "但几中南返的大汉王朝却并没有重挫手机。"}, {"start": 15.92, "end": 20.92, "text": "公元一把警员,十四岁的汉少帝刘变继位。"}, {"start": 20.92, "end": 25.92, "text": "执掌外戚势力的大将军郭靖,为了彻底剿除黄昆士命,"}, {"start": 25.92, "end": 30.92, "text": "侵袭袁绍的一箭,密令董卓统军进行。"}, {"start": 30.92, "end": 38.92, "text": "三国,这个长达一百多年混乱纷争的时代,就这样拉开了血流。"}, {"start": 40.92, "end": 48.92, "text": "公元一把警员,董卓为少帝刘变,礼臣刘王刘邪继位,"}, {"start": 48.92, "end": 51.92, "text": "视为汉县帝。"}, {"start": 51.92, "end": 57.92, "text": "董卓被拜为相国,权倾朝野,天忍共怒。"}, {"start": 57.92, "end": 60.92, "text": "所以激起居国之疑愤。"}, {"start": 60.92, "end": 68.49, "text": "陛下有旨,找百官恭送董相国出宫。"}, {"start": 68.49, "end": 74.66, "text": "臣等恭送董相国出宫。"}, {"start": 87.29, "end": 88.29, "text": "起!"}, {"start": 93.2, "end": 119.21, "text": "帝政帝退朝。"}, {"start": 119.21, "end": 139.74, "text": "禀大人,今儿是司徒王允大人寿诞。"}, {"start": 139.74, "end": 142.74, "text": "王大人已在府中备下酒席,请大人赴宴。"}, {"start": 142.74, "end": 152.88, "text": "王司徒请了董卓命,请传告司徒大人,老夫一定去赴宴,一定去,一定去。"}, {"start": 153.88, "end": 180.0, "text": "小公公。"}, {"start": 180.0, "end": 181.0, "text": "曹大人。"}, {"start": 181.0, "end": 188.79, "text": "我都等了你半天了,你就没有什么信儿要传给我吗?"}, {"start": 188.79, "end": 200.17, "text": "你刚才对所有人都窃窃私语了一番,却为何不对我说呢?"}, {"start": 200.17, "end": 203.17, "text": "你是瞧不起我曹操吗?"}, {"start": 203.17, "end": 207.82, "text": "太傅大人啊,您看出来了吗?"}, {"start": 207.82, "end": 220.47, "text": "王司徒寿宴所请之人全都是先皇的旧臣。"}, {"start": 220.47, "end": 221.47, "text": "自然如此。"}, {"start": 221.47, "end": 224.47, "text": "在下以为王司徒起宴绝非是。"}, {"start": 224.47, "end": 225.47, "text": "袁大人。"}, {"start": 225.47, "end": 226.47, "text": "袁大人。"}, {"start": 226.47, "end": 228.47, "text": "曹孟哲。"}, {"start": 228.47, "end": 230.47, "text": "在下先辞告退。"}, {"start": 230.47, "end": 232.47, "text": "好,请便。"}, {"start": 234.47, "end": 240.47, "text": "大家都是同朝臣臣,可是有些人凶却耻于我曹操为主。"}, {"start": 240.47, "end": 242.47, "text": "孟德,果然有见识啊。"}, {"start": 242.47, "end": 249.47, "text": "如蒙太傅不弃,想与你为伍,陪你走几步,不知可否。"}, {"start": 249.47, "end": 250.47, "text": "听凭尊义。"}, {"start": 250.47, "end": 251.47, "text": "请。"}, {"start": 251.47, "end": 258.68, "text": "袁大人,今日可是司徒王大人的寿诞吗?"}, {"start": 258.68, "end": 262.68, "text": "孟德不光眼力好,而且听力也不错。"}, {"start": 262.68, "end": 267.68, "text": "你说那个替司徒大人传话的小皇门,为什么把你们都请了去?"}, {"start": 267.68, "end": 270.68, "text": "要知道,我是最尊重你们这些先皇旧臣了。"}, {"start": 270.68, "end": 273.68, "text": "尤其是最尊重司徒王大人。"}, {"start": 273.68, "end": 278.68, "text": "老夫回答你之前,有一事也要请教足下。"}, {"start": 278.68, "end": 279.68, "text": "请大人示下。"}, {"start": 279.68, "end": 286.68, "text": "正如足下所说,王司徒请宾客,却为何偏不请你曹孟德呀?"}, {"start": 288.68, "end": 289.68, "text": "问得好。"}, {"start": 289.68, "end": 294.68, "text": "既然好,那就请你不吝赐教了。"}, {"start": 294.68, "end": 303.66, "text": "我想是因为受邀者个个都是出自名门豪祖,赤寿皇恩。"}, {"start": 303.66, "end": 310.36, "text": "而我曹操在你们眼里却是烟患之后,阿杂不堪。"}, {"start": 310.36, "end": 314.36, "text": "一个卑贱之徒怎能与列位尊者为伍呢?"}, {"start": 314.36, "end": 319.36, "text": "曹孟德能把话说到这个境界上,已经很了不起了。"}, {"start": 319.36, "end": 322.36, "text": "不过,还有些原因。"}, {"start": 322.36, "end": 325.36, "text": "袁大人真的要让我都说出来吗?"}, {"start": 325.36, "end": 327.36, "text": "是你要与老夫同行的。"}, {"start": 327.36, "end": 335.18, "text": "同行若不同道,这与行尸走肉又有何意呢?"}, {"start": 335.18, "end": 339.18, "text": "袁大人,我只是想问问你。"}, {"start": 339.18, "end": 341.18, "text": "是你要与老夫同行的。"}, {"start": 341.18, "end": 346.18, "text": "同行若不同道,这与行尸走肉又有何意呢?"}, {"start": 346.18, "end": 352.77, "text": "好,那我就说了。"}, {"start": 352.77, "end": 357.77, "text": "受邀者个个都是先皇旧臣。"}, {"start": 357.77, "end": 362.77, "text": "也个个都是以王允为首的弟长心父。"}, {"start": 362.77, "end": 367.77, "text": "而我曹操在你们看起来,却平行轻贱。"}, {"start": 367.77, "end": 371.77, "text": "干为鹰犬,躯身是贼。"}, {"start": 371.77, "end": 375.77, "text": "族下怎么不说了?你接着往下说呀。"}, {"start": 375.77, "end": 378.77, "text": "你怎么个轻贱法?怎么个躯身法?"}, {"start": 378.77, "end": 383.77, "text": "你做的是哪家的鹰犬?你试的又是哪家的贼?"}, {"start": 383.77, "end": 386.77, "text": "国贼董卓吗?"}, {"start": 386.77, "end": 387.77, "text": "你想什么?"}, {"start": 387.77, "end": 389.77, "text": "怎么了袁大人?"}, {"start": 389.77, "end": 396.77, "text": "这国贼二字,不是早就被你们这帮公卿大臣分子碎了牙?"}, {"start": 396.77, "end": 398.77, "text": "凑碎了心了吗?"}, {"start": 398.77, "end": 401.77, "text": "怎么在这光天化日之下,"}, {"start": 401.77, "end": 406.77, "text": "京师皇宫之中却不敢大声地说出来呢?"}, {"start": 406.77, "end": 410.77, "text": "你们不是把金鸾殿都视为圣地?"}, {"start": 410.77, "end": 414.77, "text": "那么多道貌岸然的公卿大臣,"}, {"start": 414.77, "end": 418.77, "text": "都敬若寒蝉,胆战心惊。"}, {"start": 418.77, "end": 423.77, "text": "这才让我真正地看到了什么是尊,什么是卑,"}, {"start": 423.77, "end": 427.77, "text": "看到了尊卑的别样意境。"}, {"start": 427.77, "end": 433.77, "text": "一个小小的本体,却是自命清高者,进城数倍。"}, {"start": 433.77, "end": 436.77, "text": "你!你!你!"}, {"start": 437.77, "end": 464.77, "text": "请,请。"}, {"start": 464.77, "end": 469.77, "text": "万宫六十华贷,在下,恭喜财寿。"}, {"start": 469.77, "end": 472.77, "text": "多谢,多谢,请请请。"}, {"start": 472.77, "end": 476.77, "text": "请请请。"}, {"start": 476.77, "end": 484.11, "text": "该来的都来了吗?"}, {"start": 484.11, "end": 489.11, "text": "回老爷的话,所请的顶客一个不少,都来了。"}, {"start": 489.11, "end": 495.11, "text": "好,关闭大门,熄掉灯笼,停止奏运。"}, {"start": 495.11, "end": 499.11, "text": "不要惊动了寻夜的鹰泉。"}, {"start": 499.11, "end": 509.56, "text": "遵命。"}, {"start": 509.56, "end": 512.56, "text": "列位,请。"}, {"start": 516.57, "end": 519.57, "text": "好酒,好酒。"}, {"start": 519.57, "end": 521.57, "text": "来来来。"}, {"start": 521.57, "end": 551.25, "text": "请请请。"}, {"start": 551.25, "end": 562.22, "text": "老爷,有一人自称是萧继校尉曹操,不请自到,非要给你拜寿。"}, {"start": 562.22, "end": 564.22, "text": "曹操?"}, {"start": 564.22, "end": 570.22, "text": "曹阿满,真是太无礼了,几乎厚颜无耻啊。"}, {"start": 570.22, "end": 573.22, "text": "董卓一进京,曹操就拜入董贼门下,"}, {"start": 573.22, "end": 580.22, "text": "卑躬屈膝,妖宠线媚,简直是丢尽了世子人臣的脸面啊。"}, {"start": 580.22, "end": 587.22, "text": "是啊,开头他还是隔日一朝拜,可是现在的竟然是晨暗暮醒,紧紧跟随。"}, {"start": 587.22, "end": 590.22, "text": "他实为相夫之鹰犬。"}, {"start": 590.22, "end": 594.22, "text": "这个人啊,我看简直就像是董卓的干儿子。"}, {"start": 594.22, "end": 599.22, "text": "禀司徒大人,曹操此行,必是来替董卓当耳目,打探消息的。"}, {"start": 599.22, "end": 601.22, "text": "是,是,是。"}, {"start": 601.22, "end": 604.22, "text": "大人,让他赶出去,让他赶出去。"}, {"start": 604.22, "end": 608.18, "text": "未必。"}, {"start": 608.18, "end": 617.84, "text": "据老夫看来,曹操这个人不像是董卓的鹰犬之辈。"}, {"start": 617.84, "end": 621.84, "text": "起码他不甘于沦为慈悲。"}, {"start": 621.84, "end": 631.84, "text": "曹操这个人啊,一向有大志,表面屈奉,暗中掏回。"}, {"start": 631.84, "end": 638.54, "text": "在心腹之间 恐怕别有所图啊"}, {"start": 639.3, "end": 641.18, "text": "是啊 大人说得有道理"}, {"start": 641.18, "end": 641.78, "text": "是啊"}, {"start": 641.78, "end": 643.02, "text": "话又说回来了"}, {"start": 643.5, "end": 647.3, "text": "人家口口声声是说来给我拜寿的"}, {"start": 648.3, "end": 651.3, "text": "我岂能将贺客逐出门外呢"}, {"start": 653.02, "end": 653.7, "text": "管家"}, {"start": 653.94, "end": 654.42, "text": "在"}, {"start": 655.62, "end": 658.66, "text": "在门旁增设一墨席"}, {"start": 659.34, "end": 662.98, "text": "制小鸡一张 小斩一具"}, {"start": 664.34, "end": 666.22, "text": "赐曹操入席吧"}, {"start": 666.42, "end": 666.82, "text": "是"}, {"start": 668.1, "end": 672.27, "text": "曹大人"}, {"start": 673.67, "end": 675.87, "text": "司徒大人请曹大人赴宴"}, {"start": 676.83, "end": 677.31, "text": "带路"}, {"start": 677.87, "end": 678.27, "text": "请"}, {"start": 678.87, "end": 679.59, "text": "曹大人请"}, {"start": 680.31, "end": 689.7, "text": "暖身曹操"}, {"start": 690.42, "end": 693.02, "text": "恭祝司徒王宫六十大寿"}, {"start": 693.54, "end": 696.91, "text": "多谢"}, {"start": 698.39, "end": 699.59, "text": "请入席吧"}, {"start": 700.27, "end": 719.3, "text": "曹操谢座"}, {"start": 720.54, "end": 721.18, "text": "列位"}, {"start": 722.54, "end": 723.06, "text": "请"}, {"start": 723.06, "end": 723.7, "text": "请"}, {"start": 723.7, "end": 724.34, "text": "请"}, {"start": 724.34, "end": 724.94, "text": "请"}, {"start": 725.1, "end": 725.78, "text": "列位"}, {"start": 736.39, "end": 737.19, "text": "今天"}, {"start": 737.91, "end": 740.07, "text": "并不是老夫的生日"}, {"start": 740.47, "end": 741.47, "text": "相反"}, {"start": 744.34, "end": 747.46, "text": "是老夫的忌日"}, {"start": 747.98, "end": 753.76, "text": "老夫借生日之名"}, {"start": 754.8, "end": 757.0, "text": "把大家聚于寒舍"}, {"start": 757.0, "end": 759.24, "text": "是想告诉列位"}, {"start": 759.72, "end": 765.91, "text": "我四百年的大汉王朝"}, {"start": 766.47, "end": 769.55, "text": "已经到了最后的地步"}, {"start": 769.63, "end": 771.83, "text": "最后的关头啊"}, {"start": 772.79, "end": 774.39, "text": "江山沦丧"}, {"start": 774.95, "end": 776.51, "text": "日月无光"}, {"start": 777.79, "end": 779.67, "text": "宗庙涂灰"}, {"start": 780.83, "end": 782.87, "text": "俱坚篡国"}, {"start": 784.23, "end": 786.27, "text": "天子收儒"}, {"start": 787.07, "end": 789.31, "text": "君臣蒙羞"}, {"start": 791.44, "end": 792.96, "text": "内有董贼"}, {"start": 793.52, "end": 795.0, "text": "横行于朝"}, {"start": 795.32, "end": 798.24, "text": "外有群雄称霸于野"}, {"start": 799.24, "end": 801.36, "text": "故乎哀哉"}, {"start": 802.04, "end": 804.16, "text": "笔崩月坏"}, {"start": 805.2, "end": 806.36, "text": "肝肠"}, {"start": 807.52, "end": 809.16, "text": "寸断了"}, {"start": 810.04, "end": 810.92, "text": "还有呢"}, {"start": 811.16, "end": 813.36, "text": "董贼每夜都闯入皇宫"}, {"start": 813.36, "end": 814.64, "text": "夜宿龙踏"}, {"start": 815.0, "end": 816.2, "text": "任意奸淫"}, {"start": 816.2, "end": 817.72, "text": "嫔妃宫女"}, {"start": 817.96, "end": 820.16, "text": "星通禽兽啊"}, {"start": 830.45, "end": 831.17, "text": "曹操"}, {"start": 832.01, "end": 833.33, "text": "为何失效"}, {"start": 835.62, "end": 837.1, "text": "满辈是在笑"}, {"start": 838.58, "end": 839.94, "text": "满做大丈夫"}, {"start": 840.3, "end": 841.98, "text": "尽做女儿态"}, {"start": 843.38, "end": 845.62, "text": "你们就是从天黑哭到天明"}, {"start": 846.62, "end": 848.54, "text": "难道能把董贼哭死不成"}, {"start": 848.98, "end": 850.14, "text": "你有何能"}, {"start": 850.14, "end": 852.18, "text": "出言竟如此轻薄"}, {"start": 852.18, "end": 853.42, "text": "曹某不才"}, {"start": 854.26, "end": 855.18, "text": "谈之之间"}, {"start": 855.18, "end": 856.7, "text": "便可将董贼的手机"}, {"start": 856.7, "end": 858.58, "text": "取下玄于长乐宫门"}, {"start": 859.78, "end": 861.14, "text": "太狂妄了"}, {"start": 861.46, "end": 863.26, "text": "狂妄之子"}, {"start": 863.54, "end": 864.14, "text": "太狂妄了"}, {"start": 864.14, "end": 864.7, "text": "来人"}, {"start": 864.7, "end": 865.3, "text": "在"}, {"start": 866.02, "end": 869.26, "text": "将大胆狂屠曹阿蛮"}, {"start": 869.26, "end": 870.58, "text": "赶下大唐"}, {"start": 870.58, "end": 871.7, "text": "逐出府外"}, {"start": 871.7, "end": 872.22, "text": "下去"}, {"start": 872.66, "end": 873.18, "text": "起来"}, {"start": 874.18, "end": 875.1, "text": "走 走"}, {"start": 875.78, "end": 876.46, "text": "且慢 且慢"}, {"start": 876.46, "end": 878.02, "text": "司徒大人 请听我一言"}, {"start": 879.7, "end": 880.34, "text": "说"}, {"start": 884.26, "end": 885.46, "text": "你这个人"}, {"start": 885.78, "end": 886.9, "text": "虽然愚腐"}, {"start": 887.9, "end": 890.02, "text": "但你府上的酒很不错"}, {"start": 891.18, "end": 892.94, "text": "你这么愚腐的人"}, {"start": 892.94, "end": 895.1, "text": "怎么配得上这么好的酒呢"}, {"start": 895.42, "end": 896.1, "text": "可惜"}, {"start": 896.42, "end": 897.06, "text": "可惜了"}, {"start": 897.06, "end": 897.86, "text": "拿下去"}, {"start": 898.34, "end": 899.34, "text": "你下来把他拉走"}, {"start": 899.34, "end": 900.34, "text": "可惜"}, {"start": 900.34, "end": 902.14, "text": "可惜好酒了"}, {"start": 903.22, "end": 914.47, "text": "你走嘛你"}, {"start": 914.47, "end": 915.15, "text": "赶紧滚"}, {"start": 915.15, "end": 915.95, "text": "快滚 滚吧"}, {"start": 918.34, "end": 919.46, "text": "疏背"}, {"start": 920.58, "end": 921.74, "text": "疏背"}, {"start": 921.74, "end": 935.43, "text": "疏背"}, {"start": 935.43, "end": 936.55, "text": "曹将军"}, {"start": 936.55, "end": 937.87, "text": "曹将军"}, {"start": 937.87, "end": 949.82, "text": "请留步"}, {"start": 949.82, "end": 950.78, "text": "曹将军"}, {"start": 952.38, "end": 953.46, "text": "眼皮一眨"}, {"start": 953.46, "end": 954.78, "text": "老母鸡便压"}, {"start": 955.78, "end": 956.66, "text": "怎么曹阿蛮"}, {"start": 956.66, "end": 958.1, "text": "又变成曹将军了"}, {"start": 959.42, "end": 960.5, "text": "事态严良"}, {"start": 960.5, "end": 961.66, "text": "转瞬间呀"}, {"start": 962.38, "end": 964.34, "text": "你这奴才有何话说"}, {"start": 964.98, "end": 966.18, "text": "曹将军"}, {"start": 966.18, "end": 967.3, "text": "我家主公"}, {"start": 967.3, "end": 970.34, "text": "令奴才再三向曹将军谢罪"}, {"start": 971.94, "end": 972.86, "text": "我家主公说"}, {"start": 972.86, "end": 975.06, "text": "宴席之上人多口杂"}, {"start": 975.06, "end": 976.86, "text": "取董卓投炉之事"}, {"start": 976.86, "end": 978.46, "text": "万万不可言及"}, {"start": 978.46, "end": 980.58, "text": "所以才杨作大怒"}, {"start": 980.58, "end": 982.7, "text": "将曹将军赶了出来"}, {"start": 982.7, "end": 985.5, "text": "这也是为了保护曹将军啊"}, {"start": 985.5, "end": 987.78, "text": "请将军到书房稍候"}, {"start": 987.78, "end": 989.14, "text": "待宾客散去"}, {"start": 989.14, "end": 990.14, "text": "我家主公"}, {"start": 990.14, "end": 992.5, "text": "自会亲来向你谢罪"}, {"start": 993.74, "end": 995.78, "text": "这倒是颇向亡孕的为人"}, {"start": 997.02, "end": 998.06, "text": "好吧"}, {"start": 998.06, "end": 1000.78, "text": "那我就先到书房稍候"}, {"start": 1000.78, "end": 1002.34, "text": "不过酒席上的酒"}, {"start": 1002.34, "end": 1003.78, "text": "你得给我拿两壶"}, {"start": 1003.78, "end": 1005.06, "text": "不能让我枯坐"}, {"start": 1006.02, "end": 1007.54, "text": "管狗 管狗"}, {"start": 1016.42, "end": 1021.44, "text": "梦德兄"}, {"start": 1021.44, "end": 1023.2, "text": "梦德兄酒厚了"}, {"start": 1023.2, "end": 1025.0, "text": "老夫深感不安"}, {"start": 1025.0, "end": 1026.84, "text": "谨此再拜"}, {"start": 1026.84, "end": 1030.3, "text": "深知歉意"}, {"start": 1030.3, "end": 1032.18, "text": "司徒大人太不客气了"}, {"start": 1033.18, "end": 1036.1, "text": "敢问恭请大臣们都走了吗"}, {"start": 1036.1, "end": 1038.22, "text": "刚刚离去"}, {"start": 1038.22, "end": 1040.7, "text": "实才席上人多"}, {"start": 1040.7, "end": 1042.66, "text": "老夫不便细叙"}, {"start": 1042.66, "end": 1046.12, "text": "请问梦德兄"}, {"start": 1046.12, "end": 1047.88, "text": "真有诸贼妙计吗"}, {"start": 1047.88, "end": 1050.19, "text": "当然"}, {"start": 1050.19, "end": 1051.15, "text": "请"}, {"start": 1060.69, "end": 1062.53, "text": "我草草"}, {"start": 1062.53, "end": 1065.33, "text": "既非卖主求荣之徒"}, {"start": 1065.33, "end": 1068.73, "text": "更非虚言欺世之辈"}, {"start": 1068.73, "end": 1072.25, "text": "实才席间列为恭请"}, {"start": 1072.25, "end": 1075.34, "text": "实在是误解我了"}, {"start": 1075.5, "end": 1077.54, "text": "我屈身是贼"}, {"start": 1077.54, "end": 1079.3, "text": "实则是为了杀贼"}, {"start": 1080.74, "end": 1081.86, "text": "如何杀贼"}, {"start": 1081.86, "end": 1082.66, "text": "大人"}, {"start": 1083.62, "end": 1086.02, "text": "我已经完完全全地"}, {"start": 1086.02, "end": 1088.38, "text": "得到了郭贼董卓的信任"}, {"start": 1089.18, "end": 1091.82, "text": "尽管相府假示凌厉"}, {"start": 1091.82, "end": 1093.66, "text": "防范慎严"}, {"start": 1093.66, "end": 1096.02, "text": "我却可以无需禀报"}, {"start": 1096.02, "end": 1099.93, "text": "直达相府的内怨"}, {"start": 1099.93, "end": 1101.97, "text": "只是这董卓"}, {"start": 1101.97, "end": 1104.01, "text": "内衣里总是穿着一件"}, {"start": 1104.01, "end": 1105.53, "text": "贴身的铠甲"}, {"start": 1106.77, "end": 1109.77, "text": "寻常的刀剑都不能伤他"}, {"start": 1109.77, "end": 1111.41, "text": "不知道大人是否还记得"}, {"start": 1111.41, "end": 1113.17, "text": "去年春上"}, {"start": 1113.17, "end": 1114.65, "text": "五府首持立任"}, {"start": 1114.65, "end": 1116.33, "text": "刺杀董卓的事"}, {"start": 1116.33, "end": 1119.25, "text": "就是因为没有能够穿透铠甲"}, {"start": 1119.25, "end": 1121.53, "text": "这才功亏一篑"}, {"start": 1121.53, "end": 1122.85, "text": "惨遭灭祖"}, {"start": 1127.73, "end": 1131.59, "text": "梦德兄的意思是"}, {"start": 1131.59, "end": 1133.87, "text": "我是听说司徒大人的府上"}, {"start": 1133.87, "end": 1136.95, "text": "有一口祖传的七星宝刀"}, {"start": 1136.95, "end": 1139.75, "text": "能削金断玉 锐不可当"}, {"start": 1139.75, "end": 1141.11, "text": "对吗"}, {"start": 1141.11, "end": 1144.15, "text": "如果大人能把这口宝刀借给我"}, {"start": 1144.15, "end": 1147.23, "text": "我愿意怀揣宝刀进入相府"}, {"start": 1148.15, "end": 1152.55, "text": "七进 寻机图之"}, {"start": 1152.55, "end": 1154.59, "text": "如图铸狗"}, {"start": 1154.59, "end": 1156.11, "text": "董卓一死"}, {"start": 1156.11, "end": 1158.11, "text": "西梁军群龙无首"}, {"start": 1158.11, "end": 1159.75, "text": "必定溃散"}, {"start": 1159.75, "end": 1165.98, "text": "那时大势谈之可定"}, {"start": 1165.98, "end": 1170.79, "text": "相府行刺"}, {"start": 1170.79, "end": 1172.43, "text": "如此一来"}, {"start": 1172.43, "end": 1173.79, "text": "梦德兄自己"}, {"start": 1173.79, "end": 1178.52, "text": "不也是有去无回了吗"}, {"start": 1178.52, "end": 1180.68, "text": "制食魏国除害"}, {"start": 1180.68, "end": 1183.08, "text": "岂能够洗一己性命"}, {"start": 1184.24, "end": 1186.68, "text": "如果能把董卓的头颅"}, {"start": 1186.68, "end": 1188.92, "text": "挂在城门之上"}, {"start": 1188.92, "end": 1192.68, "text": "我曹操便可轻视留名"}, {"start": 1192.68, "end": 1194.44, "text": "如果不能"}, {"start": 1194.44, "end": 1196.56, "text": "那么挂在城门上的"}, {"start": 1196.56, "end": 1198.76, "text": "就可能是我曹某的头"}, {"start": 1198.76, "end": 1200.56, "text": "但是即便如此"}, {"start": 1200.56, "end": 1205.62, "text": "我也在所不辞"}, {"start": 1205.62, "end": 1206.66, "text": "曹将军"}, {"start": 1207.66, "end": 1212.62, "text": "如果你真能手刃巨贼"}, {"start": 1212.62, "end": 1217.42, "text": "那必让功盖天地万事不朽"}, {"start": 1217.42, "end": 1221.62, "text": "四百年大旱皇朝之命运"}, {"start": 1221.62, "end": 1223.62, "text": "此时此刻"}, {"start": 1223.62, "end": 1231.41, "text": "就托付于梦德兄之手了"}, {"start": 1231.41, "end": 1235.96, "text": "那我就取刀了"}, {"start": 1235.96, "end": 1238.43, "text": "且慢"}, {"start": 1238.43, "end": 1239.95, "text": "梦德兄"}, {"start": 1239.95, "end": 1243.43, "text": "你以为他就是七星宝刀吗"}, {"start": 1243.59, "end": 1245.15, "text": "莫非他不是"}, {"start": 1245.15, "end": 1260.75, "text": "请稍候"}, {"start": 1260.75, "end": 1262.07, "text": "当时第一的宝刀"}, {"start": 1262.07, "end": 1265.58, "text": "竟然如此制不"}, {"start": 1265.58, "end": 1268.02, "text": "世间奇珍异宝"}, {"start": 1268.02, "end": 1271.34, "text": "往往不在其表"}, {"start": 1271.34, "end": 1274.72, "text": "三日之内"}, {"start": 1274.72, "end": 1276.6, "text": "名垂青史"}, {"start": 1276.6, "end": 1279.36, "text": "血渐长红"}, {"start": 1279.36, "end": 1282.32, "text": "四百年大旱王朝"}, {"start": 1282.32, "end": 1328.49, "text": "尽托于曹将军之手了"}, {"start": 1328.49, "end": 1331.73, "text": "萧綦校尉拜见相国"}, {"start": 1331.73, "end": 1332.81, "text": "大人请"}, {"start": 1332.85, "end": 1335.33, "text": "你们就不打算搜索"}, {"start": 1335.33, "end": 1337.93, "text": "看我身上带没带兵刃"}, {"start": 1337.93, "end": 1339.13, "text": "那是对外人的"}, {"start": 1339.13, "end": 1340.73, "text": "您就不必拘礼了"}, {"start": 1340.73, "end": 1341.57, "text": "大人请"}, {"start": 1374.98, "end": 1376.22, "text": "相国恕罪"}, {"start": 1376.22, "end": 1378.26, "text": "曹操来迟了"}, {"start": 1378.26, "end": 1379.66, "text": "好"}, {"start": 1379.66, "end": 1381.38, "text": "梦德来了"}, {"start": 1381.38, "end": 1382.42, "text": "好好好"}, {"start": 1382.42, "end": 1387.1, "text": "来来来"}, {"start": 1387.1, "end": 1388.46, "text": "梦德"}, {"start": 1388.46, "end": 1391.54, "text": "我来给你引荐一下"}, {"start": 1391.54, "end": 1393.46, "text": "这是我的义子"}, {"start": 1393.46, "end": 1394.78, "text": "吕布"}, {"start": 1394.78, "end": 1396.82, "text": "自奉先"}, {"start": 1396.86, "end": 1399.26, "text": "他是刚刚从西梁"}, {"start": 1399.26, "end": 1400.9, "text": "引军回京"}, {"start": 1401.9, "end": 1403.5, "text": "吕布将军的威名"}, {"start": 1403.5, "end": 1405.78, "text": "在下早就如雷贯耳了"}, {"start": 1405.78, "end": 1407.18, "text": "世人云"}, {"start": 1407.18, "end": 1408.34, "text": "人中吕布"}, {"start": 1408.34, "end": 1409.74, "text": "马中吃土"}, {"start": 1409.74, "end": 1411.5, "text": "再加上将军手里那杆"}, {"start": 1411.5, "end": 1412.78, "text": "方天画脊"}, {"start": 1412.78, "end": 1413.9, "text": "真可看"}, {"start": 1413.9, "end": 1415.22, "text": "人间罕见"}, {"start": 1415.22, "end": 1416.82, "text": "天下无敌"}, {"start": 1418.42, "end": 1419.46, "text": "奉先"}, {"start": 1419.46, "end": 1420.86, "text": "听到了吗"}, {"start": 1420.86, "end": 1423.18, "text": "这个曹梦德这张嘴"}, {"start": 1423.18, "end": 1424.98, "text": "那才叫天下无敌呢"}, {"start": 1427.38, "end": 1428.86, "text": "梦德言过了"}, {"start": 1428.86, "end": 1430.06, "text": "吕布不敢当"}, {"start": 1431.5, "end": 1432.38, "text": "梦德"}, {"start": 1432.38, "end": 1433.78, "text": "你怎么才来"}, {"start": 1433.78, "end": 1436.02, "text": "我都等你半天了"}, {"start": 1436.02, "end": 1437.5, "text": "臣的做计"}, {"start": 1437.5, "end": 1438.86, "text": "雷若不堪"}, {"start": 1438.86, "end": 1440.5, "text": "因此迟到"}, {"start": 1440.5, "end": 1441.94, "text": "臣告罪"}, {"start": 1441.94, "end": 1445.78, "text": "你官拜萧继校尉"}, {"start": 1445.78, "end": 1448.46, "text": "怎么连匹骏马都没有"}, {"start": 1448.46, "end": 1450.78, "text": "相国有所不知"}, {"start": 1450.78, "end": 1452.22, "text": "开春以来"}, {"start": 1452.22, "end": 1454.14, "text": "天下大旱"}, {"start": 1454.18, "end": 1457.06, "text": "眼下京师是人断梁骨"}, {"start": 1457.06, "end": 1458.74, "text": "马无草料"}, {"start": 1458.74, "end": 1460.06, "text": "臣的做计"}, {"start": 1460.06, "end": 1461.94, "text": "快被生生地扼杀了"}, {"start": 1461.94, "end": 1463.78, "text": "那可不成"}, {"start": 1463.78, "end": 1464.82, "text": "那不成"}, {"start": 1464.82, "end": 1466.54, "text": "扼杀了谁也不能扼杀了"}, {"start": 1466.54, "end": 1469.14, "text": "你曹梦德的做计"}, {"start": 1470.58, "end": 1471.86, "text": "我有刚刚寄上来的"}, {"start": 1471.86, "end": 1474.14, "text": "西粮汉学马"}, {"start": 1474.14, "end": 1475.34, "text": "奉献"}, {"start": 1475.34, "end": 1478.18, "text": "你亲自去挑选一匹豪马"}, {"start": 1478.18, "end": 1481.68, "text": "赠予梦德"}, {"start": 1481.68, "end": 1483.08, "text": "遵命"}, {"start": 1483.08, "end": 1487.7, "text": "有劳将军了"}, {"start": 1487.7, "end": 1489.38, "text": "谢相国"}, {"start": 1490.46, "end": 1491.66, "text": "梦德"}, {"start": 1491.66, "end": 1494.18, "text": "来"}, {"start": 1494.18, "end": 1496.94, "text": "咱们两个说个话"}, {"start": 1503.1, "end": 1504.38, "text": "梦德"}, {"start": 1504.38, "end": 1505.86, "text": "咱家问你"}, {"start": 1505.86, "end": 1509.46, "text": "你和那个袁绍袁本初"}, {"start": 1509.46, "end": 1510.9, "text": "熟吗"}, {"start": 1510.9, "end": 1513.5, "text": "臣和袁本初自小相识"}, {"start": 1513.5, "end": 1517.49, "text": "但臣和他尊卑不同"}, {"start": 1517.49, "end": 1520.01, "text": "袁绍这个王八蛋"}, {"start": 1520.01, "end": 1520.93, "text": "咱家进城那会儿"}, {"start": 1520.93, "end": 1522.93, "text": "就该把他宰了"}, {"start": 1522.93, "end": 1525.57, "text": "那个时候估计他名气大"}, {"start": 1525.57, "end": 1527.21, "text": "当时我一丝心软"}, {"start": 1527.21, "end": 1531.13, "text": "就让这小子跑出了京师"}, {"start": 1531.13, "end": 1532.65, "text": "没想到啊"}, {"start": 1532.65, "end": 1534.13, "text": "他今天竟然纠结了"}, {"start": 1534.13, "end": 1536.01, "text": "十八路诸侯"}, {"start": 1536.01, "end": 1538.17, "text": "起兵反我"}, {"start": 1538.17, "end": 1540.17, "text": "相国修经"}, {"start": 1541.29, "end": 1543.01, "text": "袁绍徒有西名"}, {"start": 1543.01, "end": 1544.41, "text": "绝无大才"}, {"start": 1544.41, "end": 1545.41, "text": "十八镇诸侯"}, {"start": 1545.41, "end": 1548.05, "text": "也绝不是西粮军的对手"}, {"start": 1548.05, "end": 1550.77, "text": "相国只要遣吕布将军"}, {"start": 1550.77, "end": 1552.49, "text": "率三万铁骑"}, {"start": 1552.53, "end": 1554.29, "text": "定可大获全胜"}, {"start": 1554.29, "end": 1555.29, "text": "那是"}, {"start": 1555.29, "end": 1557.49, "text": "那是"}, {"start": 1557.49, "end": 1558.77, "text": "我除了李奉先之外"}, {"start": 1558.77, "end": 1561.25, "text": "我还有李雀郭四二将"}, {"start": 1561.25, "end": 1562.09, "text": "他们两个也是"}, {"start": 1562.09, "end": 1565.25, "text": "个个都有万夫不挡之用"}, {"start": 1565.25, "end": 1566.77, "text": "杀他十八路诸侯"}, {"start": 1566.77, "end": 1571.21, "text": "如同屠诛宰狗一般"}, {"start": 1571.21, "end": 1573.21, "text": "臣以为"}, {"start": 1573.21, "end": 1574.89, "text": "最重要的是"}, {"start": 1574.89, "end": 1576.85, "text": "有相国你"}, {"start": 1576.85, "end": 1580.01, "text": "相国带兵如韩信"}, {"start": 1580.01, "end": 1582.21, "text": "治国如萧河"}, {"start": 1582.21, "end": 1584.93, "text": "我大汉开国四百年"}, {"start": 1584.93, "end": 1587.21, "text": "何曾有过相国这样的"}, {"start": 1587.21, "end": 1589.57, "text": "惊天伪地之才"}, {"start": 1595.81, "end": 1597.85, "text": "曹孟德呀曹孟德"}, {"start": 1599.57, "end": 1601.29, "text": "听你说话呀"}, {"start": 1601.29, "end": 1602.97, "text": "就是让人高兴"}, {"start": 1604.93, "end": 1606.77, "text": "孟德呀"}, {"start": 1606.77, "end": 1610.09, "text": "咱家想再问你个事"}, {"start": 1610.09, "end": 1613.42, "text": "相国时下"}, {"start": 1613.42, "end": 1615.34, "text": "咱家知道"}, {"start": 1615.34, "end": 1616.9, "text": "那些宫廷大臣们"}, {"start": 1616.9, "end": 1618.9, "text": "表面净我心里头是"}, {"start": 1618.9, "end": 1620.1, "text": "很透了我"}, {"start": 1620.1, "end": 1622.14, "text": "恨不得把我的脑袋"}, {"start": 1622.14, "end": 1624.06, "text": "掉到城门之上"}, {"start": 1625.46, "end": 1626.86, "text": "你和这些宫廷大臣们"}, {"start": 1626.86, "end": 1628.34, "text": "关系不错"}, {"start": 1628.34, "end": 1629.98, "text": "咱家问你"}, {"start": 1629.98, "end": 1631.42, "text": "袁绍起兵的消息"}, {"start": 1631.42, "end": 1632.94, "text": "传来以后"}, {"start": 1632.94, "end": 1634.62, "text": "这些个人"}, {"start": 1634.62, "end": 1638.7, "text": "有些什么异常举动"}, {"start": 1638.7, "end": 1642.02, "text": "太大的动静倒是没有"}, {"start": 1642.02, "end": 1643.62, "text": "前天晚上是王四徒"}, {"start": 1643.62, "end": 1645.02, "text": "六师大寿"}, {"start": 1645.02, "end": 1647.34, "text": "宫廷大臣们都去赴宴了"}, {"start": 1647.34, "end": 1649.78, "text": "臣也不请自去"}, {"start": 1649.78, "end": 1650.94, "text": "想带相国去"}, {"start": 1650.94, "end": 1652.94, "text": "探一下他们的风声"}, {"start": 1652.94, "end": 1654.26, "text": "可是没料到"}, {"start": 1654.26, "end": 1657.69, "text": "被他们给插出来了"}, {"start": 1659.21, "end": 1660.69, "text": "这些个家伙"}, {"start": 1660.69, "end": 1662.77, "text": "真是不是东西"}, {"start": 1665.13, "end": 1666.37, "text": "一个一个地坐实"}, {"start": 1666.37, "end": 1668.69, "text": "朝廷俸禄养得肥肥胖胖"}, {"start": 1668.69, "end": 1669.77, "text": "除了在心里头"}, {"start": 1669.77, "end": 1670.77, "text": "骂咱家之外"}, {"start": 1670.77, "end": 1672.49, "text": "没有什么别的本事"}, {"start": 1673.33, "end": 1674.09, "text": "咱家恨不得"}, {"start": 1674.09, "end": 1675.89, "text": "砍了他们的脑袋"}, {"start": 1675.89, "end": 1677.61, "text": "用他们的肉煮汤喝"}, {"start": 1677.61, "end": 1679.89, "text": "不成啊 相国"}, {"start": 1679.89, "end": 1681.97, "text": "大凡正人君子"}, {"start": 1681.97, "end": 1684.05, "text": "其肉都太酸"}, {"start": 1686.49, "end": 1688.57, "text": "是酸 是酸"}, {"start": 1689.97, "end": 1692.25, "text": "这咱家一想起来"}, {"start": 1692.25, "end": 1695.13, "text": "这牙就觉得酸倒了"}, {"start": 1703.17, "end": 1704.73, "text": "洛阳这个鬼地方"}, {"start": 1704.73, "end": 1707.05, "text": "比起西凉来那是热多了"}, {"start": 1707.77, "end": 1708.89, "text": "你看 你看"}, {"start": 1708.89, "end": 1710.73, "text": "夏庭还没到吗"}, {"start": 1710.73, "end": 1712.73, "text": "这就把人热死了"}, {"start": 1713.73, "end": 1714.89, "text": "孟德"}, {"start": 1715.89, "end": 1717.93, "text": "我到里边去窝一会"}, {"start": 1720.73, "end": 1721.97, "text": "刘神相国"}, {"start": 1721.97, "end": 1723.25, "text": "相国"}, {"start": 1724.53, "end": 1792.69, "text": "禀相国"}, {"start": 1793.41, "end": 1820.66, "text": "在下近日"}, {"start": 1820.66, "end": 1823.38, "text": "得到一件无价的物品"}, {"start": 1823.54, "end": 1825.54, "text": "得到一件无价之宝"}, {"start": 1825.54, "end": 1827.02, "text": "七星刀"}, {"start": 1827.74, "end": 1830.7, "text": "臣想如此绝品"}, {"start": 1830.7, "end": 1832.78, "text": "臣怎配使用"}, {"start": 1833.46, "end": 1836.9, "text": "臣知道相国酷爱兵器"}, {"start": 1836.9, "end": 1837.62, "text": "诺"}, {"start": 1837.62, "end": 1841.02, "text": "臣想把它敬献给相国"}, {"start": 1843.46, "end": 1848.39, "text": "拿来我瞧瞧"}, {"start": 1848.39, "end": 1850.63, "text": "这是一把普通的刀吗"}, {"start": 1850.63, "end": 1852.39, "text": "平凡之至"}, {"start": 1852.39, "end": 1854.51, "text": "怎么能说是绝品呢"}, {"start": 1855.11, "end": 1893.6, "text": "相国可否借刀一用"}, {"start": 1893.6, "end": 1894.4, "text": "我的天哪"}, {"start": 1894.4, "end": 1897.08, "text": "世上竟有如此厉害的刀啊"}, {"start": 1898.24, "end": 1899.4, "text": "绝了"}, {"start": 1900.56, "end": 1902.6, "text": "这真叫一个绝呀"}, {"start": 1903.76, "end": 1906.0, "text": "如此宝物何人配用"}, {"start": 1906.0, "end": 1907.28, "text": "唯有像相国这样的"}, {"start": 1907.28, "end": 1911.04, "text": "圣主明君才可配此宝物啊"}, {"start": 1911.04, "end": 1912.52, "text": "孟德啊"}, {"start": 1912.52, "end": 1916.6, "text": "你对咱家真是一片忠诚"}, {"start": 1916.6, "end": 1922.79, "text": "咱家在这儿谢你了"}, {"start": 1922.79, "end": 1924.87, "text": "相国厚恩"}, {"start": 1924.87, "end": 1927.63, "text": "臣只恨无以为报"}, {"start": 1957.78, "end": 1969.66, "text": "孟德"}, {"start": 1969.66, "end": 1970.9, "text": "吕将军"}, {"start": 1970.9, "end": 1971.94, "text": "何为"}, {"start": 1971.94, "end": 1973.1, "text": "孟德"}, {"start": 1973.1, "end": 1974.42, "text": "莫非你忘了"}, {"start": 1974.42, "end": 1976.74, "text": "相国让我送你一匹坐骑"}, {"start": 1978.3, "end": 1979.62, "text": "你看看此马如何"}, {"start": 1979.62, "end": 1981.18, "text": "它可是我亲自为你挑选的"}, {"start": 1981.18, "end": 1983.62, "text": "一匹西粮汉鞋马"}, {"start": 1983.62, "end": 1986.58, "text": "可日行八百里"}, {"start": 1986.58, "end": 1987.78, "text": "此马如此雄俊"}, {"start": 1987.78, "end": 1989.86, "text": "让我极其不可惜了"}, {"start": 1991.14, "end": 1992.74, "text": "孟德兄言过了"}, {"start": 1992.74, "end": 1994.3, "text": "宝马配英雄嘛"}, {"start": 1994.98, "end": 1996.58, "text": "在下可否一试"}, {"start": 1997.18, "end": 1997.98, "text": "请"}, {"start": 2006.28, "end": 2013.98, "text": "孟德兄啊"}, {"start": 2013.98, "end": 2015.58, "text": "此马性烈"}, {"start": 2016.06, "end": 2018.1, "text": "若想让它俯首听命"}, {"start": 2018.1, "end": 2020.34, "text": "非得要有一身英雄气不可"}, {"start": 2020.34, "end": 2022.18, "text": "你何不报贺一声试试"}, {"start": 2022.54, "end": 2023.26, "text": "义父"}, {"start": 2047.43, "end": 2048.43, "text": "奉献"}, {"start": 2048.91, "end": 2050.87, "text": "看见曹操了吗"}, {"start": 2051.35, "end": 2053.03, "text": "刚才在府门外相遇了"}, {"start": 2053.03, "end": 2054.91, "text": "末将奉命把一匹骏马"}, {"start": 2054.91, "end": 2055.95, "text": "交给了他"}, {"start": 2056.87, "end": 2058.19, "text": "他急忙上马试骑"}, {"start": 2058.19, "end": 2059.27, "text": "狂奔不止呢"}, {"start": 2061.83, "end": 2062.67, "text": "奉献啊"}, {"start": 2063.51, "end": 2065.59, "text": "曹操刚才送给咱家"}, {"start": 2065.59, "end": 2067.19, "text": "一剑宝刀啊"}, {"start": 2067.19, "end": 2067.95, "text": "看"}, {"start": 2068.23, "end": 2072.31, "text": "此物真乃是天下绝品哪"}, {"start": 2072.31, "end": 2073.51, "text": "血铁如泥"}, {"start": 2073.79, "end": 2076.11, "text": "方才就这么一刀下去"}, {"start": 2076.11, "end": 2076.91, "text": "你看到没有"}, {"start": 2076.91, "end": 2078.91, "text": "这铜镜就被剖为两半了"}, {"start": 2078.91, "end": 2079.91, "text": "这刀啊"}, {"start": 2079.91, "end": 2080.99, "text": "真是绝品"}, {"start": 2081.31, "end": 2082.07, "text": "绝品"}, {"start": 2082.47, "end": 2083.15, "text": "义父"}, {"start": 2083.47, "end": 2085.55, "text": "末将可否瞧瞧此刀"}, {"start": 2086.51, "end": 2087.63, "text": "曹操说"}, {"start": 2098.98, "end": 2100.98, "text": "它叫七星刀"}, {"start": 2101.26, "end": 2102.26, "text": "七星刀"}, {"start": 2106.91, "end": 2107.43, "text": "义父"}, {"start": 2107.79, "end": 2108.87, "text": "末将听说"}, {"start": 2109.35, "end": 2111.11, "text": "司徒王允府里也有一把"}, {"start": 2111.11, "end": 2112.83, "text": "世代相传的七星刀"}, {"start": 2113.95, "end": 2115.43, "text": "会不会就是这把刀呢"}, {"start": 2116.15, "end": 2116.91, "text": "王允"}, {"start": 2117.47, "end": 2121.83, "text": "曹操刚才说过呀"}, {"start": 2122.07, "end": 2123.75, "text": "王允寿诞时"}, {"start": 2124.15, "end": 2125.95, "text": "曹操前去拜寿"}, {"start": 2126.47, "end": 2128.71, "text": "被王允从府上给赶出来了"}, {"start": 2128.71, "end": 2129.67, "text": "既然如此"}, {"start": 2129.71, "end": 2130.27, "text": "不好"}, {"start": 2130.51, "end": 2132.19, "text": "曹操是来行刺咱家的"}, {"start": 2132.67, "end": 2133.63, "text": "你别多疑了"}, {"start": 2133.63, "end": 2141.53, "text": "多疑"}, {"start": 2141.53, "end": 2143.65, "text": "这年头就是多疑"}, {"start": 2143.65, "end": 2147.55, "text": "才救了咱家的性命"}, {"start": 2148.11, "end": 2149.59, "text": "只要刺客一靠近"}, {"start": 2149.59, "end": 2151.03, "text": "咱家就能闻出味儿"}, {"start": 2151.91, "end": 2152.75, "text": "我想起来"}, {"start": 2153.91, "end": 2156.35, "text": "方才曹操举止慌乱"}, {"start": 2156.35, "end": 2157.51, "text": "献刀的时候"}, {"start": 2157.51, "end": 2159.19, "text": "手都有一些发抖"}, {"start": 2159.83, "end": 2160.43, "text": "还有"}, {"start": 2160.75, "end": 2163.51, "text": "他既然是诚心献刀给我"}, {"start": 2163.51, "end": 2164.71, "text": "为什么不带钢镜"}, {"start": 2164.71, "end": 2165.59, "text": "来送我们家的"}, {"start": 2165.59, "end": 2166.99, "text": "王允寿"}, {"start": 2167.03, "end": 2167.95, "text": "这刀给我"}, {"start": 2167.95, "end": 2169.99, "text": "为什么不在刚见面的时候"}, {"start": 2169.99, "end": 2171.75, "text": "把刀献给咱家呢"}, {"start": 2171.75, "end": 2172.87, "text": "非等咱家在这儿"}, {"start": 2172.87, "end": 2174.15, "text": "打瞌睡的时候"}, {"start": 2174.15, "end": 2175.95, "text": "他才拔刀呈献呢"}, {"start": 2175.95, "end": 2178.51, "text": "要不是这铜镜中闪出刀光"}, {"start": 2179.03, "end": 2180.79, "text": "被咱家大喝了一声"}, {"start": 2180.79, "end": 2181.75, "text": "说不定的刀"}, {"start": 2181.75, "end": 2184.07, "text": "就插进咱家的后背心了"}, {"start": 2184.07, "end": 2186.71, "text": "曹操是被咱家喝破了形状"}, {"start": 2186.71, "end": 2188.31, "text": "才假意献刀"}, {"start": 2190.31, "end": 2190.95, "text": "来人"}, {"start": 2194.75, "end": 2195.39, "text": "相国"}, {"start": 2196.43, "end": 2198.27, "text": "立刻传曹操来见我"}, {"start": 2198.27, "end": 2198.79, "text": "诺"}, {"start": 2201.7, "end": 2202.3, "text": "驾"}, {"start": 2207.67, "end": 2208.79, "text": "快快下满眼棺"}, {"start": 2208.79, "end": 2210.55, "text": "我是萧綦校尉曹操"}, {"start": 2210.55, "end": 2212.19, "text": "相国差外有紧急差事"}, {"start": 2212.19, "end": 2213.27, "text": "快让开"}, {"start": 2213.27, "end": 2214.55, "text": "出示通牌"}, {"start": 2214.55, "end": 2215.83, "text": "让末将瞧瞧"}, {"start": 2215.83, "end": 2216.75, "text": "时间紧迫"}, {"start": 2216.75, "end": 2218.03, "text": "如果误了相国的差事"}, {"start": 2218.03, "end": 2219.27, "text": "你不怕掉脑袋吗"}, {"start": 2219.27, "end": 2220.15, "text": "快让开"}, {"start": 2231.27, "end": 2232.39, "text": "禀相国"}, {"start": 2232.39, "end": 2234.07, "text": "刚才有使者奉相国急命"}, {"start": 2234.07, "end": 2235.11, "text": "闯出东门"}, {"start": 2235.11, "end": 2236.47, "text": "末将想请示相国"}, {"start": 2236.47, "end": 2238.11, "text": "可曾派出使者"}, {"start": 2238.11, "end": 2239.27, "text": "那司是谁"}, {"start": 2239.27, "end": 2241.11, "text": "那人自称是萧綦校尉曹操"}, {"start": 2241.11, "end": 2242.51, "text": "他是刺客"}, {"start": 2242.51, "end": 2243.59, "text": "是贼子"}, {"start": 2243.59, "end": 2246.11, "text": "曹操是来行刺咱家的"}, {"start": 2247.19, "end": 2247.99, "text": "立刻传命"}, {"start": 2247.99, "end": 2249.15, "text": "出派五千甲士"}, {"start": 2249.15, "end": 2250.59, "text": "出城搜捕曹操"}, {"start": 2251.07, "end": 2251.67, "text": "遵命"}, {"start": 2262.58, "end": 2263.14, "text": "义父"}, {"start": 2264.38, "end": 2265.22, "text": "末将请命"}, {"start": 2265.98, "end": 2267.3, "text": "亲自率领铁骑"}, {"start": 2267.9, "end": 2268.78, "text": "追捕曹操"}, {"start": 2269.98, "end": 2270.74, "text": "奉献啊"}, {"start": 2271.7, "end": 2273.78, "text": "你挺喜欢这把骑行刀是吗"}, {"start": 2276.66, "end": 2277.58, "text": "末将怎敢"}, {"start": 2277.94, "end": 2279.5, "text": "我是问你喜不喜欢"}, {"start": 2279.5, "end": 2281.18, "text": "不是问你敢不敢"}, {"start": 2281.18, "end": 2281.94, "text": "直说"}, {"start": 2281.94, "end": 2283.02, "text": "喜欢不喜欢"}, {"start": 2285.27, "end": 2285.91, "text": "末将"}, {"start": 2286.91, "end": 2288.59, "text": "喜欢他就是你的了"}, {"start": 2288.59, "end": 2289.51, "text": "不过"}, {"start": 2289.51, "end": 2291.23, "text": "咱家有一个要求"}, {"start": 2291.27, "end": 2293.39, "text": "你要亲自用这把骑行刀"}, {"start": 2293.39, "end": 2295.51, "text": "割下曹操的手机"}, {"start": 2298.21, "end": 2298.61, "text": "遵命"}]